{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島で乃木どこ?放送開始っ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島では毎週金曜日なんだね。いいー?覚えとってーよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時。夜遅いんよね。ひめたんたまに寝てて見れんかったりすることもーごほっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ!第４回も配信スタートしましたね(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。ひめたんは第４回目でタレこまれたんよーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーて、ひめたん毎回「ビーム送っちゃろ!」とか思っとらんのんよ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっかい目が合ったら、反らすタイミングわからんじゃーないですかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、瞳ってキラキラしてるし、みんな瞳の色ってちょっとずつ違うし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見入っちゃうわけですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てずーっと見よったら、メンバーさんが「ひめたんビームきてあ(*ノω＼*)」とか言いながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたのがひめたんビームね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くらえーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり者"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タレこみってか、自覚症状もなけりゃ、別に隠してもないよ(ω)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーしっかりしてるってわけでもないんだけどなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーね。やらんにゃいけんことは、きっちりやりますよ。どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないわく、ひめたんはいろいろ考えてるらしいです(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ考えたことブログに書いたら、ひめきゅんのみなさんもまた一緒になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてくださるからねー嬉しいよー好きよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートありがとうございました(ω)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとおんなじ４月生まれの人は今のとこ10人!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまったくおんなじ誕生日の方が2人、妹と同じ方が1人、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらにぱぱと同じ誕生日の方も1人おりました!何日かは言わんけど('ー`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ今日の質問♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたの生まれたところはどこですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっつもアンケート結果楽しみにしとるよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、誕生日なんですぞ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日俺の誕生日やから祝って(≧▽≦)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとーうございます(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではここで、お誕生日を迎えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年一年の抱負をどうぞ聞かせて下さいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの乃木坂ふぁみりーさんの前での宣言..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいかあ(//ω//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートにちなんで今日はご当地系の質問どうぞ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香川に来たことある?どんなイメージ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香川は行ったことなーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどん県かがわ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に香川でイベントしたメンバーが、うどん美味しかったってゆっとった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また福岡に来てくれるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたーい(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ福岡ではパフォーマンスしてないし、全員ではおじゃましてないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかライブしたいです。会いにきてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、明太子とうめがえもち食べれんかったけ食べたーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徳島名産のすだちを料理に使ったりする?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんお料理せんけわからんけど、すだちって、ちょっと酸っぱいやつよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すだちってどんな時に使ったらいいのー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調味料とかになるんかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんからして関西弁ってなまってるん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なまっとる(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪出身のメンバーと話してたら(おぉ関西弁ー)て思うもんー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はぶてちょるけぇ」って大阪の友達に言ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はぶてちょる?なんじゃそりゃ」って言われた(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに山口でもはぶてるって使うよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ\"はぶてる\"って伝わらんよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"\"←このちょんちょん付けるほど珍しい言葉じゃないのに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなーはぶてるを標準語にしようよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島は語尾に\"ちょる\"ってつけて話す?(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがね、\"ちょる\"は広島は使わんのんよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島は語尾に\"とる\"ってつけるのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ読んどるー、ごはん食べとるー、こんな感じよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東ではマックで関西ではマクドって言うゆーねんで!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはどっちなんかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島はマック!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクドってゆーのは、全国でも関西だけなんよ(*'ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州とか東北とかはマックて言うっぽーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富山にもカターレ富山というＪ２のサッカーチームがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カターレ富山!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふれーふれーカターレ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現地まで会いにいって応援したいところだけど、とりあえずブログを通して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エールを送ります(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉来たときコバトン見たかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こばとん??み、みてなーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃ埼玉メンバー、埼玉出身のみなさんに聞くしかだねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こばとんてどんな子なの?かわいーい(^ω^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新潟県に来たことありますか＼(^O^)／?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないのー一回行ってみたいなって思ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪とかきれいだろうし、お米が美味しいんだよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー素敵っ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}